  "description": "A service runs in two AZs, but recovery from a Region outage takes a week. What improvement addresses an RTO requirement of one hour?",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>문제 풀이</span></nav><section class=\"quiz-page\"><div class=\"quiz-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">QUESTION 099</p><h1>문제 풀이</h1></div><strong>99 / 108</strong></div><div class=\"quiz-progress\" aria-label=\"99번째 문제\"><span style=\"width:92%\"></span></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q099\" data-question=\"Q099\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q099</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A service runs in two AZs, but recovery from a Region outage takes a week. What improvement addresses an RTO requirement of one hour?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q099\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Add another EC2 instance in the same AZ</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q099\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Change only the network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q099\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Assign a fixed Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q099\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Prepare a recovery environment and failover procedure in another Region</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 장애 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-time-objective\">RTO</a>를 줄이려면 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a>에서 정해진 시간 내 서비스를 켤 수 있는 DR 환경과 검증이 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a></div></article><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"문제 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q098/\">이전 문제 <b>Q098</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q100/\">다음 문제 <b>Q100</b></a></span></nav><p class=\"save-note\">선택과 채점 결과는 이 브라우저에 자동 저장됩니다.</p></section>"
